      "writtenOn": "2025-03-10T19:40:50Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "That wasn\u0027t my question though. I wanted to understand why your tests require CMA alocations before init starts. Sounds like without that requirement you could use dmabug heaps to get the same results (make CMA allocations).",
      "parentUuid": "0c286ceb_2cdde528",
      "revId": "31dcae769791c14068db45925c7973258daf8ba1",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
